{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"第十二局 黑马强攻反失策 红炮轰士巧入局\r\n飞相局对进7卒\r\n河北李来群先胜浙江于幼华\r\n 1982.2.8弈于北京\r\n 《象棋全盘战术指微》\r\n 第33页 第12局\r\n 李来群评注\r\n 2003.10.12（日）","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0f1","comment":"此着红方跳拐脚马，不及走兵三进一，卒7进1，车九平三更为积极。由此可见，首着黑方进7卒，主要作用是抑制红方右马，但红马尚未定位，抑制作用不大。反被红车在7路有强攻突破的机会。依笔者浅见，进7卒对付飞相是属于调子缓慢的开局，常常在7路上被红方有所利用。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7f7","comment":"如改走卒３进１，兵七进一，卒３进１，车三平七，黑方落后手。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7f1","comment":"如改走马４退２，车六进八，马３退４，炮八进五，炮６平２，兵九进一，红方略优。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4c4","comment":"红车平七，原意是利用卒3进1后，黑马不能走马2进4。但被黑马连环后红方亦难进取。此着应直接走车四平九，将４平５，车九进二，马２进４，车九进三，士５退４，车九退一，红方有攻势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5f4","comment":"黑方进马强攻求胜，因目前形势已处下风，强攻无益。正着应走马4进3，仍可求和。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2g4","comment":"是局按亚洲棋规进行比赛，此时如不飞相挡马，而改走车九平六，将４平５，车六平八，马２进１，车八退三，马６进８，士五进六，马８进７，帅五平六，车８进５，士六退五，车８退５，士五进六，车８进５，士六退五，车８退５，双方如不变，一捉一杀作和；红方如变着求胜，就要丢士相了。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4g2","comment":"第20回合，黑方仍回马6退4，还有和棋机会。现在已输两卒，车马被牵，战况愈下。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5d1","comment":"如走马８退７，马七进八，马２退３，兵七进一，象５进３，马八进七，这样，黑方右翼门户洞开，也难应付。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a5b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a3a4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i6i5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a4a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i5i4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a5b5","com